msgstr "何人が参加したか、そしてこの結果からわからないこと"

#: app/templates/consultations/_report_body.html:196
#, python-format
msgid ""
"These results describe the %(num)d person who took part. People choose "
"whether to take part, so participants may differ from those who did not. "
"This is not a poll of everyone who was invited, or of the public."
msgid_plural ""
"These results describe the %(num)d people who took part. People choose "
"whether to take part, so participants may differ from those who did not. "
"This is not a poll of everyone who was invited, or of the public."
msgstr[0] ""
"この結果は、参加した %(num)d "
"人についてのものです。参加するかどうかは本人が選ぶため、参加者と、参加しなかった人とでは違いがあるかもしれません。招待した全員や、一般の人々を対象にした世論調査ではありません。"

#: app/templates/consultations/_report_body.html:201
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Turnout was low. Clear results usually need %(recommended)d or more "
"participants, so treat these results with caution."
msgstr ""
"参加者が少なめでした。はっきりした結果を得るには、通常 %(recommended)d 人以上の参加者が必要なため、この結果は慎重に扱ってください。"

#: app/templates/consultations/_report_body.html:203
msgid ""
"A result is called only when the votes clearly support it, allowing for how "
"many people voted. With few votes, even a large majority is reported as “no "
"clear result”."
msgstr ""
"結果は、投票した人数を考慮したうえで、投票がそれを明確に裏付ける場合にのみ示されます。票が少ない場合は、大きな過半数であっても「明確な結果なし」と報告されます。"

#: app/templates/consultations/_report_body.html:204
msgid ""
"Percentages are of everyone who voted on that statement, including those who"
" answered “unsure”. People could skip statements, so the number of votes "
"differs between statements."
msgstr ""
"割合は、その主張に投票した全員を母数としており、「わからない」と答えた人も含みます。主張はスキップできたため、主張ごとに投票数は異なります。"

#: app/templates/consultations/_report_body.html:205
msgid ""
"Taking part was anonymous, with one set of answers per device. Someone using"
" two devices would be counted twice."
msgstr "参加は匿名で、1台の端末につき1組の回答です。2台の端末を使った人は、2回数えられます。"

#: app/templates/consultations/_report_body.html:208
msgid ""
"This example uses made-up votes. In your report every figure is counted "
"directly from the votes; the headline, themes and suggested questions are "
"written by AI from those results and checked by software, so they describe "
"the results and do not add to them."
msgstr ""
"この例では、架空の投票を使っています。実際のレポートでは、すべての数値が投票から直接集計されます。見出し、テーマ、提案される問いは、その結果をもとに "
"AI が書き、ソフトウェアで検証しているため、結果を説明するだけで、何かを付け加えることはありません。"

#: app/templates/consultations/_report_body.html:210
msgid ""
"Every figure in this report is counted directly from the votes. The "
"headline, themes and suggested questions were written by AI from those "
"results and checked by software: they describe the results and do not add to"
